Package: mica-systemd-boot
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Mica OS <hi@micaos.dev>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: systemd-boot EFI loader with persisted boot attempts
 One file, /usr/lib/mica/systemd-boot/systemd-bootx64.efi or systemd-bootaa64.efi:
 the systemd-boot of the systemd release the base system ships, patched so that
 an entry whose boot attempts are exhausted is never selected and a boot whose
 attempt counter cannot be written is refused. It is unsigned; the boot chain
 signs it and places it on the EFI system partition.
